  "title": "A Modulo-Five Congruence for Overcolored Partition 4-Tuples Restricted by Parity of the Parts",
  "batch_label": "51",
  "kind": "resolution-paper",
  "original_status": "proved",
  "scope": "Let f_j=(q^j;q^j)_infinity and define a(N) by f_4^8/(f_1^16 f_2^8)=sum_{N>=0} a(N)q^N in Z[[q]]. Then a(5n) is congruent to 0 modulo 5 for every integer n>=1; equivalently, U_5(f_4^8/(f_1^16 f_2^8)) is congruent to 1 modulo 5.",
